  "notes": "Combined implementation, not another generic checking stage. Personal-note permanent decryption requires save fence, a fresh known certificate password and explicit confirmation. Preserve the complete encrypted archive; stage/validate original ZIP; atomic file publication with ordinary SQL/file rollback; report backup/recovery-required instead of claiming crash/concurrent-writer atomicity. Existing list/info entrypoints use the new workflow; legacy password-free API refuses conversion. Post-commit metadata/body notifications and plain-note gate transition. Protected screenshots retain pixels only in memory after intentional hide; new post-capture authorization on the exact original note/page/certificate is required before resource writes or insertion. Hard session/lock/sleep escalates earlier soft inactivity and discards capture; unsaved DOM/saves remain. Actual temporary database/ZIW/ZIP/resources/saver/fences/file replacement/rollback and extracted routing methods, synthetic UI/capture/page/session collaborators. Three affected groups1287/0; no full/native suite. Intermediate include/API build errors and three legacy-vs-protected capture fixture failures retained locally. Remaining external lawful signing/service contract and actual native-client acceptance are not local feature implementation tasks. Normal Touch ID disabled, recovery OFF, automation PAUSED. No real accounts/notes/Keychain/services/security tests/package/install. Source-only backup.",
